  "method": "FP32 seeded Lab02 MyNet 50 parameter tensors 2,420,547 elements; matched CUDA/Vulkan optimizer variants; 12 warmups and 60/75/80/100 timed synchronized full steps, 12 warmups 100 optimizer-only steps; stage diagnostics with separate synchronization; static gradients GPU resident in isolated optimizer. Eager Vulkan GPU timestamp diagnosis a separate instrumented mode.",
  "caveats": [
    "Adam has coupled weight decay; AdamW has decoupled weight decay; they are not substitutable",
    "Native Vulkan AdamW is opt-in, supports only contiguous FP32 and subset of PyTorch options, not a drop-in default replacement",
    "CUDA torch.optim fused=True uses a native vertical/horizontal fused implementation; Vulkan torch.optim fused=True currently lacks an aten fused dispatch, raises when CPU fallback forbidden",
    "Vulkan GPU shader timestamps were collected on V100 in a distinct eagerly submitted instrumented mode; their totals are not directly subtractable from deferred normal wall time",
    "V100 and RTX benchmarks run on different GPUs; no RX7800 XT measurements were collected during this task",
    "Lab02 model definition is from local private NIS checkout and intentionally not copied into public repo"
  ],
